WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.070
<v Dana, security desk>In January, 1 in 3 clicked our drill. By May, after monthly drills, it was 1 in 5.

2
00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:11.770
<v Dana, security desk>Where do you think clicks were by November? Draw the rest of the line.

3
00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.790
<v Dana, security desk>Every team clicks less than in January.

4
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:22.110
<v Dana, security desk>Finance, sales and HR fell to 3 or 4%. IT started low.

5
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:27.460
<v Dana, security desk>The warehouse started highest, at 41%, and still clicks most.
